    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LUCY: Thanks, Sue. Nice haircut.\nSUE: Thanks.\nSUE: That was a long break.",
      "SUE: There's no future in this. It can never work.\nLUCY: Cute haircut.\nSUE: Thanks.\nLUCY: Have you ever gotten your period two weeks early?",
      "LUCY: Why is she a Miss? She should be a Mrs.\nSUE: Are you kidding? Just look at her. Who would marry that?\nLUCY: No, I think it's the other way around. She looks that way because she's a Miss.\nLUCY: She lives to cook breakfast but she never found her true love so she was forced to cook for strangers all her life.",
      "LUCY: Hello! Today's date! Can you read? Do they not teach you to count in cop school?\nCOP: I'm adding a hundred for hostile behavior. Better simmer down.\nSUE: Officer!\nLUCY: You! Tell me I'm not crazy. What's today's date?",
      "LUCY: Okay. Bye.\nSUE: What?\nLUCY: My life was all about helping people. I taught children and I volunteered at the senior center. I loved it. I was good at it."
    ]
  },
